Package: inbook-x2-audio
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: rasyidrafi <rasyidrafi@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: linux-image-6.12.118+deb13-amd64, kmod, alsa-ucm-conf, firmware-sof-signed, wireplumber, pulseaudio-utils
Description: Board-specific SOF speaker routing for the Ice Lake Infinix INBOOK X2
 Includes a kernel-specific machine driver, ALSA UCM profile and optional
 user-session recovery timer. Not for the X2 Plus or X2 Slim.
